@segment   conversion-box
@title     Energy Conversion Box
@level     F10
@protected Energy Conversion Box
@seed      2727

say Firstly, bring to mind your {Energy Conversion Box|Energy Conversion Box}. Picture it clearly. A large, strong container with a heavy lid that can hold anything you place inside.
pause 8
say Begin placing into the box everything that may interfere with your experience today. Thoughts, distractions, leftover tension. Worries, whether physical, emotional, or mental, all belong in the box.
pause 10
say If it helps, place your entire physical body into the box for now. {You're not abandoning it.|You are not abandoning it.} You're simply letting it rest.
pause 8
say Once you've placed everything inside, close the heavy lid, and gently turn your attention away.
pause 12
